<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16817" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύνετος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξ-,</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>void of understanding, witless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				31
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				493
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.142
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					456
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τάδ᾽ ἀσύνετα</span>; what
				<i>folly</i> is this? <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				352
			</span></i> (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.141b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>not able to understand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.713b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.218b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not to be understood, unintelligible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1205
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1731
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					1.8.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
